note Rebuilds every edge in the index from scratch, so the GUI runs it on a thread over a text-free copy and the CLI once after all servers answered. Server targets resolve by (file, line) through a path-to-slot map; tree-sitter calls go through resolve. Its cost is call sites times same-named candidates, which is what makes a repo full of 'new' slow to link.

