note The server half of an edge is a (file, line), so the target is the innermost symbol covering that line. Nothing is guessed. link does this lookup inline off a path-to-slot map it builds once, because a target is named once per call site and find_file's scan would be a pass over every file each time; this is the same rule, and what the rest of the tool calls.

